WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.531
- Every show I pick out something awesome

00:00:01.531 --> 00:00:03.690
from social media and share it with you.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.100
Hopefully it makes you smile.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.432
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.432 --> 00:00:09.240
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.630
If you're a lover of football like myself

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.021
chances are you might
be in a fantasy league

00:00:15.021 --> 00:00:16.800
while many people just play for fun.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.240
For some groups,

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.670
the punishment for losing
can be pretty harsh.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.400
Just look at what one
Chicago guy was subjected to.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.821
- So sorry.

00:00:24.821 --> 00:00:26.712
I'm going to be here a very long time.

00:00:26.712 --> 00:00:29.490
I lost my fantasy football league

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:30.360
and my punishment is

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.352
I have to be here for 24 hours

00:00:32.352 --> 00:00:35.280
and the only way I can get time taken off

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.390
is for every pancake I eat.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:38.370
- [Kelly] Wait, what?

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.070
- Yeah, I, It sounds absurd.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:41.090
(laughs)

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.581
- It really does.

00:00:42.581 --> 00:00:43.414
(laughs)

00:00:43.414 --> 00:00:46.320
10 pancakes in 14 hours
in the diner later.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:49.500
We have this very good
sport on the line right now.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.411
Everybody say hi to Connor

00:00:50.411 --> 00:00:54.021
watching on NBC Chicago at 3:00.

00:00:54.021 --> 00:00:55.381
What's up Connor?

00:00:55.381 --> 00:00:57.030
- Hi Kelly.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.520
Thank you so much for having me.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:00.000
- Oh my God, absolutely.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.160
How were the pancakes?

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.130
(laughs)

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:03.330
- Oh man, you know what?

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.120
The first few delicious.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:08.520
It's after pancake five or six.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:10.152
They don't quite taste quite the same.

00:01:10.152 --> 00:01:12.720
- Yeah. It's a little bit of a punishment.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:14.940
Who came up with this punishment?

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.680
- So this fantasy group

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.630
is a group of buddies from high school

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:20.700
and some of us even went
to first grade together.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:21.533
We go way back,

00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:24.660
but now we live in five different states.

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:26.100
We're in four different time zones.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:26.933
We're spread out

00:01:26.933 --> 00:01:29.760
and fantasy football really
has kept our friendships alive.

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.541
It's been a beautiful thing for all of us,

00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:34.260
but we do this punishment

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.672
to just keep each other
accountable and spice things up.

00:01:36.672 --> 00:01:39.750
And we had heard the
lore of this punishment

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.520
but we'd never seen anyone do it.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.890
You know, it was like the
Sasquatch of punishments

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.050
but we wanted to do it

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:46.980
and document it

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.741
so the world could see that it's done.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:51.680
And so I was a huge advocate for it

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.512
because I didn't think I'd ever do it.

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:54.651
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:54.651 --> 00:01:57.232
I love your fantasy lead team.

00:01:57.232 --> 00:01:58.830
That's incredible.

00:01:58.830 --> 00:01:59.663
And I love

00:01:59.663 --> 00:02:01.110
that it's kept your friendships
alive for that long.

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:01.943
That's so cool.

00:02:01.943 --> 00:02:03.870
Thank you Connor for sharing.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:05.072
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:05.072 --> 00:02:06.381
I'm sorry to eat all those pancakes

00:02:06.381 --> 00:02:07.331
but that's not all.

00:02:07.331 --> 00:02:11.131
Our season long partner
pilot pen makers of G2

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.491
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show.

00:02:13.491 --> 00:02:16.579
Want to honor truly unstoppable people

00:02:16.579 --> 00:02:18.072
just like you Pancake man.

00:02:18.072 --> 00:02:19.680
So they're going to be writing you

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.120
a cheque for a thousand dollars.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.651
How's that sound?

00:02:22.651 --> 00:02:24.519
- Oh My God.

00:02:24.519 --> 00:02:26.160
- [Kelly] So Connor,

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.000
- That's incredible.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.221
Thank you so much.

00:02:28.221 --> 00:02:29.054
- Connor.

00:02:29.054 --> 00:02:30.810
It's like a loss, but really a win.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.181
Really a win at the end of the day.

00:02:32.181 --> 00:02:34.199
Thank you so much.

00:02:34.199 --> 00:02:35.282
Thank Connor.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:38.708
Thank you to all our guests,

00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:41.070
Tim Allen, Elizabeth Allen-Dick

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:43.680
Misty Copeland, Bonnie,
Dan and Lawrence Zarian.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:44.610
And y'all have a great band.

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.180
If it's not, try harder .

